  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{証拠|しょうこ}を{隠蔽|いんぺい}する - to conceal evidence\n・{事実|じじつ}を{隠蔽|いんぺい}する - to cover up facts\n・{情報|じょうほう}{隠蔽|いんぺい} - information concealment\n・{隠蔽|いんぺい}{工作|こうさく} - cover-up operation\n\nNUANCE:\nThis word has a strongly negative connotation, implying deliberate and often illegal concealment of wrongdoing.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n・{発覚|はっかく} - coming to light (opposite outcome)\n・{暴露|ばくろ} - exposure (the act of revealing)\n・{捏造|ねつぞう} - fabrication",
